<title>USA: Bryn Mawr Bank approves share buyback.</title>
<headline>Bryn Mawr Bank approves share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>BRYN MAWR, Pa. 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bryn Mawr Bank Corp said it has authorized the repurchase of up to $4 million of common stock, but not more than five percent of the outstanding stock.</p>
<p>The buyback program is set for the year March 24, 1997, to March 31, 1998, the company said.</p>
<p>Bryn Mawr Bank currently has 2.2 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
